== Quest Start ==
Talk to Sarkis Ebonblade in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'hail Sarkis Ebonblade'
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'Greetings.  Have you come here to test your dark powers of skill and spell casting? ''
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'You will be tested by either Gragrot or Tynicon.  Choose one! ''

= Gragrot =

You say, 'I choose gragrot'
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'Gragrot it is!  Take this book (Shadowy Virtues) and read it.  When you are finished, hand it back to me and I shall summon Gragrot to test you.'' 
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'Farewell. ''
:''Gragrot says 'I am here to do your bidding, Shadowknight Spirit! ''
You say, 'hail Gragrot'
:Gragrot says 'Hail!  So you think you are a mighty Knight of Shadows?  We must test these skills.  Are you ready to begin the test? Or do you think you have already proof of your deeds? ''
You say, 'I have proof of my deeds'
:''Gragrot says 'So you think you've proven yourself?  Well bring me a Sphinx Eye Amulet or a Djinni Finger Ring to claim your just reward. ''
You say, 'I am ready to begin the test'
:''Gragrot says 'Great, let us waste no more time!  I offer to you three challenges.  Bash, smash, or slash?  What do you wish to be tested in? ''

== Shadow Knight Test of Bash ==

Gragrot says 'Gragrot like bashin.  Gragrot say you like bashin too!  Give Gragrot an ebon tessera, a sphinx eye opal, and a finely crafted amulet.  Gragrot then give you sphinx eye amulet. 

'''Reward:''' {{:Amulet of the Sphinx Eye}}

