= Tynicon Dlin =

You say, 'I wish to be tested by tynicon'
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'Tynicon it is!  Take this book (Knights of the Malign) and read it.  When you are finished, hand it back to me and I shall summon Tynicon to test you. ''
:''Sarkis Ebonblade says 'Farewell. ''
:''Tynicon DLin says 'I am here to do your bidding, Shadowknight Spirit! ''
You say, 'hail Tynicon DLin'
:''Tynicon DLin says 'Hail!  So you think you are a mighty shadowknight?  Your dark magic is very important to us.  Are you ready to be tested or could it be that you have come back in hopes of a trade? ''
You say, 'I have come back in hopes of a trade'
:''Tynicon DLin says 'Ahh, well, prove to me that you have passed these tests and are worthy to wield the power I grant.  Bring me Rheumguls and I will replace it with something more fitting for your abilities. ''
You say, 'I am ready to be tested'
:''Tynicon DLin says 'Great, let us waste no more time!  I offer to you four challenges.  Disempowement, envenoming,  raising of the dead, or necropotence.  Choose one to be tested on. ''

